{"3108130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bigfoot Life", "steam_appid": 3108130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigfoot Life is a <strong>relaxing third-person simulation game</strong> where you live life as the legendary Bigfoot — foraging, exploring, and caring for the forest you call home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through lush landscapes, fish in quiet streams, and build simple shelters to survive the changing seasons. Use your mystical powers to heal wildlife and keep balance in nature. Unlock new skills, meet other creatures, and shape your own story as the forest’s unseen guardian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way across <strong>three distinct modes</strong> — <strong>Normal Mode</strong>, <strong>Survival Mode</strong>, and <strong>Free Roam Mode</strong> — each offering a different pace and challenge. Whether you want a structured journey, a gentle balance of needs, or complete freedom to explore, Bigfoot Life adapts to how you want to experience the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>not</strong> a fast-paced survival or combat game — it’s a calm, exploration-driven experience about nature, discovery, and the gentle life of Bigfoot.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/e7ac282d791043e976e8674f0b185c1b.poster.avif?t=1764079422\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/e7ac282d791043e976e8674f0b185c1b.webm?t=1764079422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/e7ac282d791043e976e8674f0b185c1b.mp4?t=1764079422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Own Bigfoot</strong> – Customize your Bigfoot’s appearance before beginning your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 <strong>Three Play Modes</strong> –</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> Balanced gameplay with light needs and gentle progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode:</strong> A slightly tougher challenge with resource management and seasonal survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Roam Mode:</strong> No objectives or limits — explore and relax freely.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Forage</strong> – Roam a living forest filled with mushrooms, berries, and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch Fish &amp; Gather Food</strong> – Hunt for small creatures, fish, and forage to sustain yourself and the animals around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Rest</strong> – Construct shelters to store items, sleep through the night, and prepare for winter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Bigfoot Skills</strong> – Gain abilities like heightened vision, strength, and mystical powers as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heal the Forest</strong> – Use Bigfoot’s Healing ability to help injured animals and restore balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Seasons &amp; Weather</strong> – Watch the world change through vibrant day-night cycles and seasonal shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful Encounters</strong> – Cross paths with humans or other Bigfoot — some curious, some cautious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing, Non-Linear Play</strong> – No strict goals or combat. Explore at your own pace and live your best Bigfoot life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Important Notes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bigfoot Life is for players who want to unwind, explore at their own pace, and connect with nature — not rush to survive it.</i><br><br>It focuses on exploration, light gathering, and environmental storytelling.   <br>It does <strong>not</strong> include complex survival systems, base-building, or heavy action. Instead, it offers a <strong>relaxing, meditative experience</strong> centered around nature, solitude, and gentle progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time of  Day, Weather, and Changing Seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/d517e0500f66c87ae3d0130845f8ed49.poster.avif?t=1764079422\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/d517e0500f66c87ae3d0130845f8ed49.webm?t=1764079422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/d517e0500f66c87ae3d0130845f8ed49.mp4?t=1764079422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bigfoot Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/6a874842841cf6a234e734ac13cafc6e.poster.avif?t=1764079422\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130/extras/6a874842841cf6a234e734ac13cafc6e.webm?t=1764079422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108130